# Heavy 3D GLB models (~60M) used ONLY by the internal /brand-kit workspace, which
# is gated to a 404 in production — so they are never served to a user and were pure
# deploy + clone weight. Kept LOCAL for brand exploration; regenerate via the Meshy
# pipeline if a fresh clone needs them. (brand-kit-assets/ stays tracked — the live
# site renders those.)
apps/web/public/models/

